# Fixture quills are engine input and golden output, compared byte-for-byte by
# the snapshot tests. A CRLF checkout (git-for-windows defaults autocrlf on)
# rewrites both sides asymmetrically (the golden file gains \r\n, the
# serialiser still emits \n), so the tree is pinned to LF everywhere instead.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored upstream assets, byte-identical to what their projects ship.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
crates/fixtures/resources/quills/cmu_letter/0.1.0/packages/tonguetoquill-cmu-letter/fonts/OFL.txt -text
